{"id":"wb-6-775","name":"大秦寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大秦寺塔","text":"大秦寺塔位于中国陕西省西安市周至县楼观镇塔峪村，地处终南山北麓，位于西安市周至县东南15公里许秦岭北麓，系唐德宗时所建，共7层，高近50米，底层直径11米有余，是一座八角形楼阁式塔。大秦是当时中国对东罗马帝国的称呼，该塔是中国现存最早的一座大秦寺（景教教堂）的遗迹。唐太宗贞观九年（635年），基督教聂斯脱利派教士叙利亚人阿罗本等首次来到长安，太宗派宰相房玄龄到郊外观迎，并准其在义宁坊建寺度僧。初称为波斯寺，唐玄宗天宝四年（745年）改称大秦寺。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E7%A7%A6%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":94864489,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94864489","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/43d3a79e5f78a003abfd34d9.jpg","title":"Da_Qin_Pagoda.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Da_Qin_Pagoda.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/65/Da_Qin_Pagoda.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"J. Coster","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"Da Qin Pagoda. May 2003.","width":320,"height":427}}